  "label": "Humor Through Defiance",
  "description": "The meme uses humor to express a form of playful defiance — the idea of choosing to wait rather than confront or engage further. This is a common comedic trope in internet culture, where passive-aggressive or resigned behavior is exaggerated for humorous effect. The child’s expression is used to anthropomorphize this behavior, making it more relatable and funny.",
